{"video_id":"wEc9aG7cRQc","title":"Why Your Agent Disagrees With Itself (And What To Do About It) - Diane Lin, Datadog","conference":"ai-engineer","language":"en","auto_generated":true,"source":"supa","timing":"exact","word_count":2872,"segments":[{"start":2.92,"duration":3.44,"text":"Hello."},{"start":4.04,"duration":5.48,"text":"This session is about"},{"start":6.36,"duration":4.76,"text":"why do your AI agents disagree with"},{"start":9.52,"duration":4.28,"text":"itself"},{"start":11.12,"duration":4.84,"text":"and what to do about it."},{"start":13.8,"duration":5.2,"text":"And this is a Dyan Huang Lin, and you"},{"start":15.96,"duration":3.04,"text":"can call me Dyan."},{"start":19.72,"duration":6.64,"text":"A little bit about my background."},{"start":22.64,"duration":5.88,"text":"My journey with AGI start from my PhD at"},{"start":26.36,"duration":5.04,"text":"Imperial College London, where I was"},{"start":28.52,"duration":5.28,"text":"working on continual learning."},{"start":31.4,"duration":6.44,"text":"Later, I worked with Professor Josh"},{"start":33.8,"duration":5.52,"text":"Tenenbaum at MIT on one-shot learning,"},{"start":37.84,"duration":4.2,"text":"meaning learning from one single"},{"start":39.32,"duration":2.72,"text":"examples."},{"start":42.6,"duration":5.0,"text":"Afterwards, I was lucky that Alexa was"},{"start":45.56,"duration":4.2,"text":"launching. I was the first three"},{"start":47.6,"duration":5.92,"text":"appliance scientists on the question"},{"start":49.76,"duration":5.8,"text":"answering team at the Alexa."},{"start":53.52,"duration":5.24,"text":"Later, attracted by a"},{"start":55.56,"duration":5.8,"text":"startup working on AGI at the Silicon"},{"start":58.76,"duration":5.0,"text":"Valley called Vicarious."},{"start":61.36,"duration":4.24,"text":"So, today Vicarious is part of the"},{"start":63.76,"duration":4.08,"text":"Google DeepMind."},{"start":65.6,"duration":5.12,"text":"And there I got to work on the exciting"},{"start":67.84,"duration":5.16,"text":"frontier research on zero-shot transfer"},{"start":70.72,"duration":5.96,"text":"learning."},{"start":73.0,"duration":7.6,"text":"After working on AGI for a few years, I"},{"start":76.68,"duration":5.48,"text":"decided to pivot to the applied world at"},{"start":80.6,"duration":4.92,"text":"Zscaler,"},{"start":82.16,"duration":5.88,"text":"which is cybersecurity company."},{"start":85.52,"duration":4.2,"text":"There I got to apply a variety of"},{"start":88.04,"duration":6.04,"text":"different machine learning model to"},{"start":89.72,"duration":4.36,"text":"adjust the cybersecurity challenge."},{"start":94.24,"duration":5.8,"text":"There for 5 years,"},{"start":96.16,"duration":6.04,"text":"uh I decided to co-found my own company"},{"start":100.04,"duration":4.44,"text":"because of pinpoint I have seen at the"},{"start":102.2,"duration":5.04,"text":"Zscaler."},{"start":104.48,"duration":6.16,"text":"So, company is building AI agent to"},{"start":107.24,"duration":8.04,"text":"auto-triage your security alerts"},{"start":110.64,"duration":5.2,"text":"and which make your SOC more efficient."},{"start":115.28,"duration":3.92,"text":"Uh"},{"start":115.84,"duration":5.64,"text":"we are super proud that Chrome innate"},{"start":119.2,"duration":5.24,"text":"has been acquired by Data Dog earlier"},{"start":121.48,"duration":6.24,"text":"this year. So now I'm part of the Data"},{"start":124.44,"duration":6.68,"text":"Dog and leading the development of"},{"start":127.72,"duration":3.4,"text":"self-evolved agent."},{"start":134.52,"duration":4.4,"text":"So today I'm going to share with you the"},{"start":137.2,"duration":4.2,"text":"problem you're probably seeing your"},{"start":138.92,"duration":5.76,"text":"day-to-day building AI agent."},{"start":141.4,"duration":5.72,"text":"The inconsistency."},{"start":144.68,"duration":4.8,"text":"Then we are discussed about where this"},{"start":147.12,"duration":5.72,"text":"inconsistency come from in order to"},{"start":149.48,"duration":3.36,"text":"figure out the solutions."},{"start":152.88,"duration":4.12,"text":"And we will discuss a few trade-off"},{"start":155.04,"duration":3.16,"text":"among the different solutions and then"},{"start":157.0,"duration":3.52,"text":"eventually we'll show you the"},{"start":158.2,"duration":5.44,"text":"experimental results to show how"},{"start":160.52,"duration":3.12,"text":"feasible they are."},{"start":166.04,"duration":5.6,"text":"You'll probably see this."},{"start":168.2,"duration":4.52,"text":"Same model, same input. But different"},{"start":171.64,"duration":4.2,"text":"output."},{"start":172.72,"duration":7.92,"text":"Here I don't mean the wording different."},{"start":175.84,"duration":4.8,"text":"I mean semantically different output."},{"start":181.68,"duration":5.88,"text":"You might be thinking that's the"},{"start":183.56,"duration":4.0,"text":"stochastic nature of LM."},{"start":187.68,"duration":5.68,"text":"Hold on to that thought. Let's look at a"},{"start":190.0,"duration":3.36,"text":"few concrete examples."},{"start":193.64,"duration":5.24,"text":"So here imagine you're giving a task for"},{"start":196.32,"duration":5.56,"text":"sentiment analysis where we're supposed"},{"start":198.88,"duration":6.92,"text":"to label each of the review of the hotel"},{"start":201.88,"duration":3.92,"text":"either positive or negative."},{"start":206.4,"duration":6.76,"text":"This is typical NLP task. And today's LM"},{"start":210.56,"duration":6.28,"text":"is really good at this."},{"start":213.16,"duration":7.6,"text":"However, there's one problem."},{"start":216.84,"duration":5.52,"text":"When you pipe this input to the same LM"},{"start":220.76,"duration":3.64,"text":"model,"},{"start":222.36,"duration":4.4,"text":"occasionally you will see different"},{"start":224.4,"duration":4.92,"text":"verdict coming out of it when you run"},{"start":226.76,"duration":5.72,"text":"multiple times."},{"start":229.32,"duration":5.68,"text":"That means a single evaluation run"},{"start":232.48,"duration":5.36,"text":"didn't tell you the whole story."},{"start":235.0,"duration":5.48,"text":"You need to repeat your"},{"start":237.84,"duration":6.88,"text":"evaluation multiple times"},{"start":240.48,"duration":4.24,"text":"in order to get a holistic picture"},{"start":244.96,"duration":5.44,"text":"by the average over the different runs"},{"start":247.8,"duration":4.56,"text":"results."},{"start":250.4,"duration":3.48,"text":"And this sounds like a technical"},{"start":252.36,"duration":3.32,"text":"inconvenience,"},{"start":253.88,"duration":3.12,"text":"but the reality"},{"start":255.68,"duration":3.96,"text":"is"},{"start":257.0,"duration":4.36,"text":"is way more problematic than just"},{"start":259.64,"duration":3.52,"text":"inconvenience."},{"start":261.36,"duration":5.32,"text":"Let me show you an example in a"},{"start":263.16,"duration":6.24,"text":"different domain in cybersecurity."},{"start":266.68,"duration":4.96,"text":"Imagine you are a security analyst where"},{"start":269.4,"duration":4.4,"text":"your day-to-day job is"},{"start":271.64,"duration":5.12,"text":"triage the security alerts"},{"start":273.8,"duration":5.36,"text":"and decide whether it's malicious that"},{"start":276.76,"duration":3.92,"text":"you need to take certain actions"},{"start":279.16,"duration":4.12,"text":"to stop the attack"},{"start":280.68,"duration":6.84,"text":"or it's false alarm, meaning it's"},{"start":283.28,"duration":4.24,"text":"actually benign, which you could ignore."},{"start":287.6,"duration":4.88,"text":"So, here example alert you got is"},{"start":290.32,"duration":4.52,"text":"there's a failed logging attempt to"},{"start":292.48,"duration":4.84,"text":"Gmail account detected from suspicious"},{"start":294.84,"duration":2.48,"text":"IP."},{"start":298.68,"duration":5.28,"text":"And if we give such similar task to this"},{"start":301.28,"duration":4.72,"text":"one to AI agent and run it different"},{"start":303.96,"duration":4.72,"text":"times,"},{"start":306.0,"duration":5.64,"text":"you will see sometimes it stay"},{"start":308.68,"duration":5.12,"text":"consistently benign, sometimes it stay"},{"start":311.64,"duration":3.6,"text":"consistently suspicious across different"},{"start":313.8,"duration":4.36,"text":"runs."},{"start":315.24,"duration":4.48,"text":"However, there are cases where it"},{"start":318.16,"duration":5.44,"text":"flip-flop"},{"start":319.72,"duration":3.88,"text":"between benign and suspicious."},{"start":323.96,"duration":3.68,"text":"Now,"},{"start":325.12,"duration":4.64,"text":"your customer will have a difficulty"},{"start":327.64,"duration":4.0,"text":"using such product"},{"start":329.76,"duration":4.08,"text":"because they will wonder, \"Which one"},{"start":331.64,"duration":5.24,"text":"should I trust?\""},{"start":333.84,"duration":5.44,"text":"So, the inconsistency"},{"start":336.88,"duration":5.0,"text":"is causing a trust issue"},{"start":339.28,"duration":5.96,"text":"in your product."},{"start":341.88,"duration":5.44,"text":"Imagine if you were in a POC bake-off,"},{"start":345.24,"duration":5.52,"text":"one vendor"},{"start":347.32,"duration":4.96,"text":"give the consistent wording all the time"},{"start":350.76,"duration":4.76,"text":"while"},{"start":352.28,"duration":5.16,"text":"the other"},{"start":355.52,"duration":4.36,"text":"vendor"},{"start":357.44,"duration":5.04,"text":"have this flip-flop wording."},{"start":359.88,"duration":4.08,"text":"You can imagine which one would win the"},{"start":362.48,"duration":3.84,"text":"deal."},{"start":363.96,"duration":5.08,"text":"Now, I'm pretty sure you want to solve"},{"start":366.32,"duration":2.72,"text":"this problem."},{"start":371.92,"duration":6.8,"text":"First, we have we have to figure out"},{"start":374.64,"duration":4.08,"text":"where the inconsistency come from."},{"start":381.24,"duration":5.0,"text":"The good news is"},{"start":383.48,"duration":5.56,"text":"the data points tend to flip-flop"},{"start":386.24,"duration":5.4,"text":"actually concentrate around"},{"start":389.04,"duration":5.0,"text":"the decision boundary, the so-called"},{"start":391.64,"duration":4.4,"text":"gray zone."},{"start":394.04,"duration":3.48,"text":"Let me illustrate with the earlier"},{"start":396.04,"duration":2.76,"text":"example."},{"start":397.52,"duration":3.52,"text":"Here"},{"start":398.8,"duration":3.52,"text":"in the sentiment analysis, we have two"},{"start":401.04,"duration":3.08,"text":"reviews."},{"start":402.32,"duration":4.36,"text":"The first one"},{"start":404.12,"duration":6.16,"text":"actually no matter how many times you"},{"start":406.68,"duration":7.28,"text":"run through the LM model, it will always"},{"start":410.28,"duration":6.6,"text":"give you the positive label."},{"start":413.96,"duration":5.8,"text":"In this case, it's pretty obvious is"},{"start":416.88,"duration":6.6,"text":"the review is super positive."},{"start":419.76,"duration":5.96,"text":"However, the second case is the one tend"},{"start":423.48,"duration":4.16,"text":"to flip."},{"start":425.72,"duration":3.92,"text":"If we look closer,"},{"start":427.64,"duration":5.08,"text":"it's kind of on the boundary."},{"start":429.64,"duration":5.84,"text":"Sometimes there's certain word is kind"},{"start":432.72,"duration":4.36,"text":"of a relative positive,"},{"start":435.48,"duration":4.36,"text":"but sometimes there's a little bit"},{"start":437.08,"duration":2.76,"text":"negative."},{"start":440.16,"duration":5.48,"text":"In this case,"},{"start":442.08,"duration":7.32,"text":"you'll find that even human experts"},{"start":445.64,"duration":6.2,"text":"will have a disagreement on these cases."},{"start":449.4,"duration":5.12,"text":"In fact, there's no right or wrong"},{"start":451.84,"duration":6.04,"text":"answer. It really depends on particular"},{"start":454.52,"duration":5.72,"text":"company's policy and their preference."},{"start":457.88,"duration":5.48,"text":"For hotel thinking that the"},{"start":460.24,"duration":5.92,"text":"such review is not something I can do to"},{"start":463.36,"duration":4.52,"text":"improve the memorial"},{"start":466.16,"duration":5.0,"text":"kind of experience,"},{"start":467.88,"duration":5.4,"text":"memorable experience. Then, that mean"},{"start":471.16,"duration":4.0,"text":"not to label as naughty because there's"},{"start":473.28,"duration":4.2,"text":"nothing I can do."},{"start":475.16,"duration":4.56,"text":"But some hotel might care about it and"},{"start":477.48,"duration":3.6,"text":"want to label them as natives so they"},{"start":479.72,"duration":4.24,"text":"can improve."},{"start":481.08,"duration":5.52,"text":"So, that comes down"},{"start":483.96,"duration":4.52,"text":"your preference."},{"start":486.6,"duration":4.12,"text":"Let's look the other cybersecurity"},{"start":488.48,"duration":4.12,"text":"example."},{"start":490.72,"duration":4.56,"text":"Here"},{"start":492.6,"duration":4.84,"text":"is another case on the boundary. And why"},{"start":495.28,"duration":4.76,"text":"it's in the boundary is"},{"start":497.44,"duration":4.52,"text":"here there's a few"},{"start":500.04,"duration":4.52,"text":"attempts."},{"start":501.96,"duration":4.04,"text":"Indeed, there's attacker knocking on the"},{"start":504.56,"duration":3.44,"text":"door."},{"start":506.0,"duration":6.56,"text":"But"},{"start":508.0,"duration":4.56,"text":"attacker might not getting yet."},{"start":512.64,"duration":4.64,"text":"So, for enterprise customers who always"},{"start":515.2,"duration":4.2,"text":"have attacker knocking on the door,"},{"start":517.28,"duration":4.16,"text":"well, if they haven't getting in the"},{"start":519.4,"duration":3.92,"text":"environment, they don't want to worry"},{"start":521.44,"duration":4.16,"text":"about it. Otherwise, they will be"},{"start":523.32,"duration":4.92,"text":"flooded by this type of alerts. There's"},{"start":525.6,"duration":6.32,"text":"nothing they need to do because they are"},{"start":528.24,"duration":6.4,"text":"blocked outside already."},{"start":531.92,"duration":5.84,"text":"However, if the attacker do manage to"},{"start":534.64,"duration":5.2,"text":"get the correct password and pass MFA"},{"start":537.76,"duration":4.72,"text":"and do manage getting the environment,"},{"start":539.84,"duration":4.68,"text":"then it become very seriously and you"},{"start":542.48,"duration":3.52,"text":"need to take certain actions."},{"start":544.52,"duration":4.76,"text":"So,"},{"start":546.0,"duration":5.84,"text":"almost similarly at the beginning"},{"start":549.28,"duration":5.32,"text":"behavior, but very different outcome and"},{"start":551.84,"duration":6.52,"text":"different response needed."},{"start":554.6,"duration":5.88,"text":"Depends on whether it's truly attack or"},{"start":558.36,"duration":4.44,"text":"attacker is still outside."},{"start":560.48,"duration":4.84,"text":"So here"},{"start":562.8,"duration":5.32,"text":"whether we label them malicious or"},{"start":565.32,"duration":5.36,"text":"benign depends on company preference"},{"start":568.12,"duration":5.48,"text":"whether they wanted to be notified about"},{"start":570.68,"duration":7.0,"text":"such situation."},{"start":573.6,"duration":7.44,"text":"So, again, this is the example where it"},{"start":577.68,"duration":5.84,"text":"depends on your preference."},{"start":581.04,"duration":5.76,"text":"And additional information to"},{"start":583.52,"duration":6.04,"text":"disambiguate between the two different"},{"start":586.8,"duration":2.76,"text":"scenarios."},{"start":590.4,"duration":4.6,"text":"So from these two very different"},{"start":591.88,"duration":5.12,"text":"domains, you will see that"},{"start":595.0,"duration":5.48,"text":"actually"},{"start":597.0,"duration":5.4,"text":"the data points tend to flip-flop."},{"start":600.48,"duration":3.48,"text":"Are the one close to the decision"},{"start":602.4,"duration":3.08,"text":"boundary"},{"start":603.96,"duration":4.12,"text":"where"},{"start":605.48,"duration":5.16,"text":"it need your clarity"},{"start":608.08,"duration":5.68,"text":"to disambiguate which side it should"},{"start":610.64,"duration":3.12,"text":"really belongs to."},{"start":614.32,"duration":5.44,"text":"So these data points are where human"},{"start":617.4,"duration":4.0,"text":"experts tend to make a mistake."},{"start":619.76,"duration":5.4,"text":"And the traditional machine learning"},{"start":621.4,"duration":6.0,"text":"classifier will also struggle with."},{"start":625.16,"duration":5.8,"text":"So in other words"},{"start":627.4,"duration":4.64,"text":"it's not your AI agent's fault."},{"start":630.96,"duration":4.28,"text":"Your AI"},{"start":632.04,"duration":6.68,"text":"agent simply point out the ambiguity"},{"start":635.24,"duration":6.08,"text":"that already exists."},{"start":638.72,"duration":2.6,"text":"So"},{"start":642.28,"duration":5.48,"text":"now we know where the root cause of the"},{"start":645.72,"duration":5.52,"text":"inconsistent is."},{"start":647.76,"duration":5.56,"text":"The next step is identify"},{"start":651.24,"duration":3.32,"text":"where exactly they are."},{"start":653.32,"duration":4.4,"text":"Who are they?"},{"start":654.56,"duration":3.16,"text":"And fix them."},{"start":659.76,"duration":6.08,"text":"Surprisingly and not surprised"},{"start":662.92,"duration":5.16,"text":"the solution to identify the gray zone"},{"start":665.84,"duration":3.6,"text":"actually exists already in machine"},{"start":668.08,"duration":5.16,"text":"learning."},{"start":669.44,"duration":4.76,"text":"And it's called active learning."},{"start":673.24,"duration":4.44,"text":"So"},{"start":674.2,"duration":5.56,"text":"the idea of active learning is"},{"start":677.68,"duration":3.52,"text":"you have a lot of data point to be"},{"start":679.76,"duration":4.36,"text":"labeled."},{"start":681.2,"duration":5.0,"text":"Imagine you'd have your initial model"},{"start":684.12,"duration":4.72,"text":"and you put it in production, maybe in"},{"start":686.2,"duration":6.16,"text":"the monitor mode."},{"start":688.84,"duration":5.04,"text":"And you wanted to check the quality."},{"start":692.36,"duration":2.92,"text":"But you don't have bandwidth to check"},{"start":693.88,"duration":3.44,"text":"all of them."},{"start":695.28,"duration":4.36,"text":"Otherwise, it lose a point of having"},{"start":697.32,"duration":4.52,"text":"agent to do the work."},{"start":699.64,"duration":3.92,"text":"But you still want to identify where the"},{"start":701.84,"duration":4.36,"text":"model"},{"start":703.56,"duration":5.0,"text":"didn't do well."},{"start":706.2,"duration":3.6,"text":"And then active learning is to find a"},{"start":708.56,"duration":2.84,"text":"way"},{"start":709.8,"duration":4.28,"text":"to select"},{"start":711.4,"duration":5.08,"text":"the data points where"},{"start":714.08,"duration":4.56,"text":"tend to make mistake."},{"start":716.48,"duration":6.04,"text":"And that's where it tells you"},{"start":718.64,"duration":3.88,"text":"where to pull your attention."},{"start":723.28,"duration":5.44,"text":"So let's go over the traditional"},{"start":726.44,"duration":4.36,"text":"um machine learning models active"},{"start":728.72,"duration":5.16,"text":"learning pipeline and see how is"},{"start":730.8,"duration":5.76,"text":"different in the case of the new LM or"},{"start":733.88,"duration":7.0,"text":"AI agent error."},{"start":736.56,"duration":6.52,"text":"So first, you train your initial model"},{"start":740.88,"duration":4.64,"text":"and then you make predictions on the"},{"start":743.08,"duration":4.0,"text":"unlabeled data set. It could be the"},{"start":745.52,"duration":3.92,"text":"production"},{"start":747.08,"duration":4.88,"text":"online data."},{"start":749.44,"duration":4.8,"text":"And then from there, you see there's"},{"start":751.96,"duration":5.72,"text":"certain cases where the model wasn't"},{"start":754.24,"duration":4.72,"text":"sure because the probability is close to"},{"start":757.68,"duration":3.12,"text":"2.5."},{"start":758.96,"duration":3.64,"text":"And those data points are the high"},{"start":760.8,"duration":3.96,"text":"informational one"},{"start":762.6,"duration":4.0,"text":"that your model is going to learn the"},{"start":764.76,"duration":5.0,"text":"most."},{"start":766.6,"duration":5.52,"text":"The uncertainty is a type of the signal"},{"start":769.76,"duration":4.08,"text":"to tell you where the model tend to make"},{"start":772.12,"duration":5.2,"text":"a mistake."},{"start":773.84,"duration":6.68,"text":"Another popular type of way to figure"},{"start":777.32,"duration":5.88,"text":"out the problematic one is query by"},{"start":780.52,"duration":4.64,"text":"committee, meaning that it by a few"},{"start":783.2,"duration":5.64,"text":"different models or even same model"},{"start":785.16,"duration":6.96,"text":"multiple times and then you identify the"},{"start":788.84,"duration":5.12,"text":"disagreement. And that's where the model"},{"start":792.12,"duration":4.08,"text":"tend to make a mistake as well and"},{"start":793.96,"duration":5.16,"text":"that's where you need human"},{"start":796.2,"duration":5.56,"text":"clarification on label so the model can"},{"start":799.12,"duration":2.64,"text":"learn it from."},{"start":803.08,"duration":6.32,"text":"The after you"},{"start":806.28,"duration":5.12,"text":"surface these problematic data points"},{"start":809.4,"duration":4.32,"text":"and for human to take a second look to"},{"start":811.4,"duration":3.28,"text":"make sure the label is actually correct"},{"start":813.72,"duration":2.44,"text":"or"},{"start":814.68,"duration":3.0,"text":"do we doesn't need additional"},{"start":816.16,"duration":4.48,"text":"information to dis"},{"start":817.68,"duration":4.16,"text":"ambiguate those cases meaning adding new"},{"start":820.64,"duration":3.12,"text":"features."},{"start":821.84,"duration":4.52,"text":"And then you can add those label data"},{"start":823.76,"duration":4.56,"text":"set or potentially additional features"},{"start":826.36,"duration":3.52,"text":"to the next round of training."},{"start":828.32,"duration":3.04,"text":"Then you retrain the model and then"},{"start":829.88,"duration":4.76,"text":"proceed"},{"start":831.36,"duration":6.68,"text":"uh continue this cycle."},{"start":834.64,"duration":5.28,"text":"So then you can see in this particular"},{"start":838.04,"duration":5.44,"text":"active learning cycle"},{"start":839.92,"duration":5.52,"text":"you spend very little uh amount or at"},{"start":843.48,"duration":5.04,"text":"least in other way it's very efficient"},{"start":845.44,"duration":6.96,"text":"way to identify the problematic data"},{"start":848.52,"duration":6.88,"text":"points and spend your attention on those"},{"start":852.4,"duration":5.64,"text":"point where your model tend to learn the"},{"start":855.4,"duration":2.64,"text":"most."},{"start":858.36,"duration":5.84,"text":"So that's the traditional one. The good"},{"start":861.2,"duration":4.16,"text":"news is the LM way"},{"start":864.2,"duration":3.32,"text":"is"},{"start":865.36,"duration":4.2,"text":"not very different."},{"start":867.52,"duration":4.84,"text":"There's a major two part which we need"},{"start":869.56,"duration":5.36,"text":"some refinement. One is on this"},{"start":872.36,"duration":5.48,"text":"selection strategy. The other part is"},{"start":874.92,"duration":2.92,"text":"about retraining."},{"start":877.96,"duration":7.76,"text":"On the selection strategy one"},{"start":880.48,"duration":7.32,"text":"um here we suggest you use the one about"},{"start":885.72,"duration":4.36,"text":"identify disagreement."},{"start":887.8,"duration":5.44,"text":"At least from what we have tried so far"},{"start":890.08,"duration":4.88,"text":"the uncertainty score from LM is not"},{"start":893.24,"duration":3.76,"text":"very reliable."},{"start":894.96,"duration":4.32,"text":"It's kind of a LM model doesn't know"},{"start":897.0,"duration":5.16,"text":"what it doesn't know. So when it's very"},{"start":899.28,"duration":5.92,"text":"confident it doesn't mean that it was"},{"start":902.16,"duration":5.84,"text":"the it would is correct. So that"},{"start":905.2,"duration":5.28,"text":"However, the the disagreement from"},{"start":908.0,"duration":5.6,"text":"different runs or from different models"},{"start":910.48,"duration":6.12,"text":"actually give you a more reliable signal"},{"start":913.6,"duration":6.4,"text":"where the model actually"},{"start":916.6,"duration":6.44,"text":"not sure about its verdict and it need"},{"start":920.0,"duration":3.04,"text":"human guidance."},{"start":925.76,"duration":4.52,"text":"And then after you identify this group"},{"start":928.68,"duration":2.24,"text":"or the"},{"start":930.28,"duration":3.04,"text":"uh"},{"start":930.92,"duration":4.4,"text":"discriminant and need attention, you"},{"start":933.32,"duration":4.04,"text":"label them and provide a feedback like"},{"start":935.32,"duration":3.6,"text":"what you did before."},{"start":937.36,"duration":3.24,"text":"Then afterwards,"},{"start":938.92,"duration":3.32,"text":"you might be thinking, \"Oh, time to"},{"start":940.6,"duration":2.84,"text":"retrain the model.\""},{"start":942.24,"duration":4.24,"text":"Yes or no."},{"start":943.44,"duration":4.0,"text":"Yes, one option is retrain the model,"},{"start":946.48,"duration":4.0,"text":"but"},{"start":947.44,"duration":5.2,"text":"fine-tuning model is expensive."},{"start":950.48,"duration":4.92,"text":"Here, we are proposing"},{"start":952.64,"duration":5.56,"text":"a more lighter weight solution, easier"},{"start":955.4,"duration":2.8,"text":"to iterate."},{"start":961.28,"duration":6.32,"text":"It's about augment your agent with"},{"start":963.52,"duration":4.08,"text":"semantic and episodic memory."},{"start":981.36,"duration":3.84,"text":"Let's use the previous example to"},{"start":983.0,"duration":3.64,"text":"illustrate what I mean here."},{"start":985.2,"duration":3.84,"text":"Um"},{"start":986.64,"duration":5.12,"text":"as we talked about, in this case, the"},{"start":989.04,"duration":4.76,"text":"attempt to flip, it's mainly missing the"},{"start":991.76,"duration":4.6,"text":"information"},{"start":993.8,"duration":5.24,"text":"about you a particular company policy or"},{"start":996.36,"duration":2.68,"text":"preference."},{"start":999.68,"duration":5.52,"text":"Here, we can add it to the um"},{"start":1003.0,"duration":4.04,"text":"the knowledge base."},{"start":1005.2,"duration":5.04,"text":"If this customer complain about"},{"start":1007.04,"duration":5.96,"text":"something outside hotel's control, then"},{"start":1010.24,"duration":6.24,"text":"classify as positive because you don't"},{"start":1013.0,"duration":3.48,"text":"want to pay attention to this."},{"start":1020.16,"duration":5.4,"text":"And then in the cybersecurity example,"},{"start":1022.88,"duration":4.96,"text":"something similar, you can put in in"},{"start":1025.56,"duration":4.0,"text":"that the password spray, meaning that"},{"start":1027.84,"duration":4.12,"text":"the attacker trying to guess your"},{"start":1029.56,"duration":4.96,"text":"password and"},{"start":1031.96,"duration":4.16,"text":"try it with different times, even fail,"},{"start":1034.52,"duration":4.04,"text":"and continuously."},{"start":1036.12,"duration":5.2,"text":"So, if without successful logging, then"},{"start":1038.56,"duration":6.36,"text":"that should be benign. But, in contrast,"},{"start":1041.32,"duration":5.6,"text":"if it succeed with final logging,"},{"start":1044.92,"duration":4.44,"text":"then that should be malicious."},{"start":1046.92,"duration":5.04,"text":"So, here you actually identify the"},{"start":1049.36,"duration":5.6,"text":"additional information to help"},{"start":1051.96,"duration":6.24,"text":"disambiguate the two and then label them"},{"start":1054.96,"duration":6.56,"text":"separately. And that's a clarity"},{"start":1058.2,"duration":7.2,"text":"that help your model to learn."},{"start":1061.52,"duration":6.76,"text":"Also, help your human experts to label"},{"start":1065.4,"duration":4.68,"text":"more consistently."},{"start":1068.28,"duration":4.76,"text":"So, this type of domain knowledge"},{"start":1070.08,"duration":5.8,"text":"sharpen your decision boundary."},{"start":1073.04,"duration":4.32,"text":"And also, help the human beings."},{"start":1075.88,"duration":3.4,"text":"And this type of knowledge is like"},{"start":1077.36,"duration":4.64,"text":"factual knowledge, is part of actually"},{"start":1079.28,"duration":5.0,"text":"belong to your semantic memory."},{"start":1082.0,"duration":3.88,"text":"And this is in contrast with the"},{"start":1084.28,"duration":4.76,"text":"episodic memory."},{"start":1085.88,"duration":5.04,"text":"Episodic memory is in the case where"},{"start":1089.04,"duration":4.16,"text":"you"},{"start":1090.92,"duration":5.88,"text":"haven't get around to distill the"},{"start":1093.2,"duration":4.68,"text":"reasoning behind the earlier case why it"},{"start":1096.8,"duration":4.56,"text":"should be"},{"start":1097.88,"duration":5.72,"text":"on malicious or the benign side."},{"start":1101.36,"duration":4.28,"text":"Instead, you said that"},{"start":1103.6,"duration":4.72,"text":"I have seen these similar cases before"},{"start":1105.64,"duration":5.16,"text":"and it was labeled as benign. And let me"},{"start":1108.32,"duration":5.12,"text":"leverage those past similar cases and"},{"start":1110.8,"duration":4.76,"text":"they made a decision accordingly."},{"start":1113.44,"duration":4.24,"text":"And the advantage of the this episodic"},{"start":1115.56,"duration":4.16,"text":"memory way is it's relatively"},{"start":1117.68,"duration":3.84,"text":"automatically. It has less human"},{"start":1119.72,"duration":3.16,"text":"intervention. I mean, the human"},{"start":1121.52,"duration":4.0,"text":"intervention was done in the past"},{"start":1122.88,"duration":3.8,"text":"already when during when you're doing a"},{"start":1125.52,"duration":3.44,"text":"job"},{"start":1126.68,"duration":4.2,"text":"online um"},{"start":1128.96,"duration":3.72,"text":"you can reference them,"},{"start":1130.88,"duration":4.0,"text":"at least your AI agent can reference"},{"start":1132.68,"duration":4.6,"text":"them automatically. They can making"},{"start":1134.88,"duration":5.0,"text":"decisions without waiting for you to"},{"start":1137.28,"duration":4.76,"text":"distill the reasoning and putting in the"},{"start":1139.88,"duration":4.88,"text":"semantic knowledge."},{"start":1142.04,"duration":6.08,"text":"So, the idea is that the"},{"start":1144.76,"duration":6.12,"text":"identify a similar case to the one under"},{"start":1148.12,"duration":5.48,"text":"examination and then leverage their past"},{"start":1150.88,"duration":4.76,"text":"decision as a reference."},{"start":1153.6,"duration":3.68,"text":"And then imagine there's a new case"},{"start":1155.64,"duration":4.44,"text":"which is coming in the middle, doesn't"},{"start":1157.28,"duration":5.08,"text":"belong to any of past group, and that's"},{"start":1160.08,"duration":3.64,"text":"the one you still need a human"},{"start":1162.36,"duration":3.4,"text":"attention."},{"start":1163.72,"duration":4.8,"text":"And this is how also"},{"start":1165.76,"duration":5.32,"text":"um where episodic memory resolve"},{"start":1168.52,"duration":4.52,"text":"recurring case"},{"start":1171.08,"duration":4.2,"text":"automatically."},{"start":1173.04,"duration":4.48,"text":"And this particular useful in the case"},{"start":1175.28,"duration":3.6,"text":"of cyber security alerts because a lot"},{"start":1177.52,"duration":3.52,"text":"of noise"},{"start":1178.88,"duration":4.92,"text":"especially those false positive noise"},{"start":1181.04,"duration":5.2,"text":"are the one keep recurring. And that's"},{"start":1183.8,"duration":4.48,"text":"the one are the low hanging fruit you"},{"start":1186.24,"duration":5.04,"text":"can automate away."},{"start":1188.28,"duration":5.4,"text":"And with that human review"},{"start":1191.28,"duration":4.68,"text":"which is a precious attention and"},{"start":1193.68,"duration":4.4,"text":"bandwidth you have, now you can"},{"start":1195.96,"duration":4.28,"text":"concentrate on those where episodic"},{"start":1198.08,"duration":5.24,"text":"memory failed to address."},{"start":1200.24,"duration":5.52,"text":"And this is also how"},{"start":1203.32,"duration":5.08,"text":"we chose between semantic memory and"},{"start":1205.76,"duration":5.16,"text":"episodic memory. The two are actually"},{"start":1208.4,"duration":5.0,"text":"not contradicting. In fact, they are"},{"start":1210.92,"duration":4.84,"text":"complementary. Basically, you use"},{"start":1213.4,"duration":5.12,"text":"episodic memory to address those"},{"start":1215.76,"duration":4.72,"text":"recurring situations automatically."},{"start":1218.52,"duration":4.56,"text":"And then for what remains still"},{"start":1220.48,"duration":5.52,"text":"reflecting after the reference from the"},{"start":1223.08,"duration":5.64,"text":"past or no reference to be able to use,"},{"start":1226.0,"duration":4.88,"text":"then you pass on to human review."},{"start":1228.72,"duration":4.2,"text":"And then human review distill the domain"},{"start":1230.88,"duration":5.92,"text":"knowledge and put it in the semantic"},{"start":1232.92,"duration":3.88,"text":"memory to be used next time."},{"start":1237.88,"duration":5.56,"text":"So here we talk about a solution"},{"start":1240.96,"duration":4.08,"text":"actually brings three benefits."},{"start":1243.44,"duration":5.56,"text":"First,"},{"start":1245.04,"duration":5.64,"text":"we identify these data point near the"},{"start":1249.0,"duration":5.52,"text":"decision boundary"},{"start":1250.68,"duration":6.76,"text":"and use the domain knowledge in semantic"},{"start":1254.52,"duration":5.72,"text":"memory and this past similar case in the"},{"start":1257.44,"duration":4.96,"text":"episodic memory, we're able to improve"},{"start":1260.24,"duration":4.0,"text":"the the consistency"},{"start":1262.4,"duration":5.88,"text":"significantly."},{"start":1264.24,"duration":7.08,"text":"So, now you have a more trustworthy"},{"start":1268.28,"duration":6.16,"text":"AI agent for your user to use."},{"start":1271.32,"duration":4.24,"text":"And two other byproduct of this solution"},{"start":1274.44,"duration":3.24,"text":"is"},{"start":1275.56,"duration":4.12,"text":"you have a very efficient quality"},{"start":1277.68,"duration":4.36,"text":"control."},{"start":1279.68,"duration":5.84,"text":"You don't need to check every"},{"start":1282.04,"duration":6.0,"text":"agent output, but instead a subset of"},{"start":1285.52,"duration":5.32,"text":"them which"},{"start":1288.04,"duration":5.72,"text":"your algorithm uh active learning think"},{"start":1290.84,"duration":4.08,"text":"is potentially problematic, and you"},{"start":1293.76,"duration":3.76,"text":"check them,"},{"start":1294.92,"duration":4.68,"text":"either provide additional information or"},{"start":1297.52,"duration":6.4,"text":"clarify the label,"},{"start":1299.6,"duration":4.32,"text":"and your model will learn from there."},{"start":1304.0,"duration":3.72,"text":"So,"},{"start":1305.56,"duration":4.04,"text":"most importantly,"},{"start":1307.72,"duration":4.28,"text":"your"},{"start":1309.6,"duration":6.88,"text":"labeling effort"},{"start":1312.0,"duration":6.52,"text":"is very small, but high return."},{"start":1316.48,"duration":4.68,"text":"Last but not least,"},{"start":1318.52,"duration":5.2,"text":"now you are gathering your customer"},{"start":1321.16,"duration":4.28,"text":"feedback along this way."},{"start":1323.72,"duration":4.12,"text":"You not only have a trustworthy"},{"start":1325.44,"duration":5.12,"text":"consistent model and high efficacy one,"},{"start":1327.84,"duration":4.08,"text":"you also have one adapt to your customer"},{"start":1330.56,"duration":3.08,"text":"environment."},{"start":1331.92,"duration":4.48,"text":"I'm pretty sure your customer will love"},{"start":1333.64,"duration":5.56,"text":"your product if you"},{"start":1336.4,"duration":5.24,"text":"your AI agent listen to them and adapt"},{"start":1339.2,"duration":2.44,"text":"to them."},{"start":1341.92,"duration":5.36,"text":"So, here are some experiment results"},{"start":1343.96,"duration":4.52,"text":"from uh real data points. So, here we"},{"start":1347.28,"duration":3.04,"text":"collect uh"},{"start":1348.48,"duration":4.16,"text":"93 alerts,"},{"start":1350.32,"duration":4.76,"text":"cybersecurity alerts, and then we run"},{"start":1352.64,"duration":4.6,"text":"them three times."},{"start":1355.08,"duration":3.32,"text":"If without the solution we are proposing"},{"start":1357.24,"duration":4.08,"text":"here,"},{"start":1358.4,"duration":4.64,"text":"a quarter of them will flip-flop the"},{"start":1361.32,"duration":5.96,"text":"verdict."},{"start":1363.04,"duration":7.04,"text":"In contrast, after applying our solution"},{"start":1367.28,"duration":5.8,"text":"or using episodic memory,"},{"start":1370.08,"duration":5.12,"text":"about 15% of them"},{"start":1373.08,"duration":4.36,"text":"become consistent."},{"start":1375.2,"duration":7.4,"text":"However, there's still 10% of them"},{"start":1377.44,"duration":7.68,"text":"remaining inconsistent. They still flip."},{"start":1382.6,"duration":5.64,"text":"Sometimes because there's no reference,"},{"start":1385.12,"duration":5.04,"text":"similar cases in past paper used."},{"start":1388.24,"duration":4.08,"text":"Sometimes even there's a reference to be"},{"start":1390.16,"duration":5.44,"text":"used they"},{"start":1392.32,"duration":5.8,"text":"still disagree after the second thought."},{"start":1395.6,"duration":4.04,"text":"But not a problem. The episodic memory"},{"start":1398.12,"duration":5.2,"text":"do the automatic"},{"start":1399.64,"duration":6.64,"text":"lock down all the inconsistency for 15%."},{"start":1403.32,"duration":6.28,"text":"The remaining 10% human review and"},{"start":1406.28,"duration":5.04,"text":"provide the additional knowledge to"},{"start":1409.6,"duration":4.4,"text":"disambiguate"},{"start":1411.32,"duration":4.32,"text":"those tricky cases."},{"start":1414.0,"duration":4.76,"text":"After that,"},{"start":1415.64,"duration":5.36,"text":"you also adapt to the"},{"start":1418.76,"duration":4.6,"text":"customer environment that you want to"},{"start":1421.0,"duration":2.36,"text":"learn."},{"start":1426.76,"duration":3.12,"text":"So,"},{"start":1427.84,"duration":6.44,"text":"the three takeaways"},{"start":1429.88,"duration":5.68,"text":"that I hope you have after this talk is"},{"start":1434.28,"duration":4.52,"text":"number one,"},{"start":1435.56,"duration":4.88,"text":"inconsistency isn't usually your model"},{"start":1438.8,"duration":4.32,"text":"problem."},{"start":1440.44,"duration":6.64,"text":"Stop blaming your model, but instead"},{"start":1443.12,"duration":6.52,"text":"focus your energy on label issue and"},{"start":1447.08,"duration":5.32,"text":"potentially insufficient information and"},{"start":1449.64,"duration":5.56,"text":"help your AI agent with this additional"},{"start":1452.4,"duration":2.8,"text":"clarity."},{"start":1455.48,"duration":5.12,"text":"Second,"},{"start":1456.96,"duration":5.56,"text":"the model disagreement isn't a bug,"},{"start":1460.6,"duration":3.96,"text":"but feature."},{"start":1462.52,"duration":6.52,"text":"Treat each disagreement as an"},{"start":1464.56,"duration":5.76,"text":"opportunity for your model to learn."},{"start":1469.04,"duration":5.0,"text":"Third,"},{"start":1470.32,"duration":6.48,"text":"fine-tuning isn't your only option."},{"start":1474.04,"duration":5.8,"text":"Augment your agent with semantic and"},{"start":1476.8,"duration":6.72,"text":"episodic memory."},{"start":1479.84,"duration":5.24,"text":"I hope you enjoy seeing your model"},{"start":1483.52,"duration":3.12,"text":"keep improving"},{"start":1485.08,"duration":4.32,"text":"and adapting to your customer"},{"start":1486.64,"duration":2.76,"text":"environment."},{"start":1490.76,"duration":6.16,"text":"Last but not least, I want to thanks to"},{"start":1493.68,"duration":6.52,"text":"my colleagues and wonderful friends at"},{"start":1496.92,"duration":6.12,"text":"Data Dog. Special thanks to Ditun and"},{"start":1500.2,"duration":6.6,"text":"Harsh, Anusha, and Stefan, Saeed, and"},{"start":1503.04,"duration":6.56,"text":"Mati to give me a lot of enjoyable"},{"start":1506.8,"duration":3.92,"text":"discussions and helped me to clarify"},{"start":1509.6,"duration":2.04,"text":"some of the"},{"start":1510.72,"duration":3.32,"text":"um"},{"start":1511.64,"duration":5.24,"text":"the concept."},{"start":1514.04,"duration":5.48,"text":"And also, thank you for everyone in the"},{"start":1516.88,"duration":5.76,"text":"Beats Secured Analyst team to make this"},{"start":1519.52,"duration":5.64,"text":"journey enjoyable."},{"start":1522.64,"duration":4.24,"text":"And thank you for listening. Hope you"},{"start":1525.16,"duration":3.64,"text":"will enjoy"},{"start":1526.88,"duration":4.56,"text":"training your model and having it"},{"start":1528.8,"duration":2.64,"text":"improving."},{"start":1531.64,"duration":3.2,"text":"Thank you. Bye."}]}